Subject: [PATCH 05/18] feat(admin): undo (Ctrl+Z), per-team strike removal,
 manual adjust and answer hotkeys

- host-side history of committed actions; undo restores scores, strikes,
  reveals and round while keeping players/settings/team names
- '- strike' per team, collapsible manual +/- adjustment of team totals
- keys 1-8 toggle answers (ignored while typing in inputs)
